					"body": "Bring the brief, explorations, and feedback together. Keep the thinking behind each decision close, from the first sketch to the final handoff."
				},
				{
					"key": "marketing",
					"tab": "03 / Marketing",
					"meta": "FOR MARKETING TEAMS",
